{"2862770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "星海乐章 | GALIX: NewHorizons | 星の旅：億万年の絆", "steam_appid": 2862770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR COMMUNITY</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862770/extras/DISCORD.jpg?t=1784903546\" /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✦ <strong>In an era dominated by gacha mobile games within the anime fandom, this is an action RPG with zero daily grind requirements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>GALIX: New Horizons</i> brings high-speed action combat to an open world. No complicated combo memorization required — dodge, chain strikes, and execute foes to pull off spectacular battles the moment you start playing. Step into the role of Hailey, a young girl awakened from an ancient civilization, and embark on adventures, forge gear, tame companions, and uncover secrets across the revitalized planet Redangard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862770/extras/58459060f922690b0a56f2984227a92c.poster.avif?t=1784903546\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862770/extras/58459060f922690b0a56f2984227a92c.webm?t=1784903546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862770/extras/58459060f922690b0a56f2984227a92c.mp4?t=1784903546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✦ <strong>No daily quests. No stamina bars. No gacha pulls. Experience all game content freely, with no mandatory daily routines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862770/extras/8ccc80963cd2d3e40d856f74bb60d138.poster.avif?t=1784903546\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862770/extras/8ccc80963cd2d3e40d856f74bb60d138.webm?t=1784903546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862770/extras/8ccc80963cd2d3e40d856f74bb60d138.mp4?t=1784903546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✦ <strong>Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch weapons, switch playstyles. From fluid sword combos to explosive gun blasts that send foes flying, every weapon boasts its own unique attack rhythm. Forge, upgrade, customize loadouts — craft a combat style entirely your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862770/extras/48c0c134661b1ec42d5e627d1b296ff2.poster.avif?t=1784903546\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862770/extras/48c0c134661b1ec42d5e627d1b296ff2.webm?t=1784903546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862770/extras/48c0c134661b1ec42d5e627d1b296ff2.mp4?t=1784903546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✦ <strong>Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient civilization’s secrets lie hidden within the ruins. Explore Redangard at your leisure, utilizing parkour, gliding and sprinting to fluidly traverse ruins and wildlands alike. Every discovery boosts your combat power: unlock new materials, crafting recipes and gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862770/extras/921183bb5d0247770d1b815845d5d4f3.poster.avif?t=1784903546\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862770/extras/921183bb5d0247770d1b815845d5d4f3.webm?t=1784903546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862770/extras/921183bb5d0247770d1b815845d5d4f3.mp4?t=1784903546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✦ <strong>Pets – Tame Your Combat Companions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pets are more than mere companions on your adventures; they fight alongside you in coordinated combat — drawing enemy aggro, casting buffs, and executing joint attacks. Feed, evolve, and customize their builds to craft a truly one-of-a-kind partner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862770/extras/691aedd90ec14fcfb05ebccb9d56e14e.poster.avif?t=1784903546\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862770/extras/691aedd90ec14fcfb05ebccb9d56e14e.webm?t=1784903546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862770/extras/691aedd90ec14fcfb05ebccb9d56e14e.mp4?t=1784903546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✦ <strong>In an era dominated by gacha mobile games within the anime fandom, this is an action RPG with zero daily grind requirements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>GALIX: New Horizons</i> brings high-speed action combat to an open world. No complicated combo memorization required — dodge, chain strikes, and execute foes to pull off spectacular battles the moment you 